WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:06.339
Now let's connect a Telegram channel.

2
00:00:06.469 --> 00:00:08.473
Groups work the same way.

3
00:00:08.790 --> 00:00:11.669
On Channels and bots, tap Add a channel.

4
00:00:11.968 --> 00:00:17.972
The first time, Castvoo asks you to link your Telegram account, so it knows the channel is yours.

5
00:00:18.272 --> 00:00:21.737
Tap Link my Telegram, then Open Telegram.

6
00:00:22.037 --> 00:00:25.460
In Telegram, press Start, then tap Yes, link it.

7
00:00:25.590 --> 00:00:27.914
Castvoo updates by itself.

8
00:00:28.212 --> 00:00:29.469
Linked.

9
00:00:29.599 --> 00:00:32.462
Now tap "Add @CastvooBot to my channel".

10
00:00:32.762 --> 00:00:35.422
Telegram opens with the bot ready.

11
00:00:35.552 --> 00:00:37.785
Pick your channel, and confirm.

12
00:00:38.086 --> 00:00:40.111
Prefer to do it by hand?

13
00:00:40.241 --> 00:00:44.677
Add the bot as an admin of your channel, with the Post messages right.

14
00:00:44.977 --> 00:00:47.984
Either way, Castvoo spots it within moments.

15
00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:50.166
Your channel is connected.

16
00:00:50.466 --> 00:00:55.137
You can now post to it from Castvoo, and it shows here with its member count.

17
00:00:55.437 --> 00:00:57.430
Planning a Welcome Flow?

18
00:00:57.560 --> 00:01:04.252
Set the channel's invite link to Approve new members, and make your own bot an admin with the Add members right.

19
00:01:04.382 --> 00:01:07.906
Castvoo checks this for you before a flow goes live.
